    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in the lovely mature development of Fr.Meehans Place within 800mts from Castlebar town centre and amenities and adjacent to the popular Greenway River Walk which extends from Castlebar town to the picturesque village of Turlough.\r\nThe property is situated in a quiet corner overlooking the green area and has the benefit of \"off street\" parking. Whilst the property requires some redecoration it offers the discerning buyer an opportunity to renovate to their own requirements."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE PORCH//STORE;\r\n1.8m x 1.8m. \r\nTiled floor/integrated ceiling lights.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL:\t\t4.85m x 1.80m\r\nUnder stair storage.Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM- 2.00m x 1.80m - Tiled flooring, white sanitary fittings wash hand basin, toilet and electric shower.\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM:\t\t 4.8m x 3.3  Fireplace with stove, brick surround, laminate flooring, ceiling light. Access to Kitchen.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING AREA: 2.10m x 3.00m\r\nTiled floor, built in kitchen units, tiled splashback , hob, fridge -Access to sunroom.\r\n \r\nSUNROOM; 3.30m x 3.30m access to rear yard. Hardwood flooring & ceiling.\r\n\r\n1ST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLANDING:\t\t\t0.80m x 0.95m\r\nCarpet over timber stairs.  Carpet over timber landing.\r\n\r\nMASTER BEDROOM:\t3.15m x 4.85m\r\nLaminate floor, built in unit.  Painted plastered walls and ceiling.  \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2:\t\t\t3.80m x 2.60m\r\nLaminate over timber floor, timber semi panels to walls, walls & timber vaulted ceiling.\r\n\t\t\r\nBATHROOM; Kitchenette.\t2.90m x 2.25m \r\nToilet , wash hand basin & shower, integrated fittings.\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Flannelly Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Flannelly Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the corre"
